[
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:0.1", "PA_ja_533:0.2"], "en": "The Jātaka: The Book of Eighty Birth Stories,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on the Lesser Swans (Cūḷahaṁsavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:0.4", "PA_ja_533:1.1"], "en": "1. The Cūḷahaṁsa Jātaka “O Sumukha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:1.2"], "en": "the birds depart without gathering [food];”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:1.3"], "en": "“Go yourself as well; do not hesitate.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:1.4"], "en": "There is no companionship for one who is bound.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:2.1"], "en": "“Whether I go or whether I do not go,”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:2.2"], "en": "One would not become immortal by that means;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:2.3"], "en": "having attended upon one who is happy,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:2.4"], "en": "how could one abandon one who is suffering?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:3.1"], "en": "Death together with you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:3.2"], "en": "or life without you— of these two,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:3.3"], "en": "death alone is better.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:3.4"], "en": "\"Even if one were to live without her,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:4.1", "PA_ja_533:4.2"], "en": "O Great King, it would not be right to abandon one who has passed away in such a manner.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:4.3"], "en": "“Whatever destiny is yours, O Lord of Birds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:4.4"], "en": "that is pleasing to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:5.1"], "en": "“What [destiny] for one bound by a snare?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:5.2"], "en": "The destinies are different from the kitchen fires;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:5.3", "PA_ja_533:5.4"], "en": "how can that [kitchen fire] be pleasing to you, who have abandoned all volitional intent?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:6.1"], "en": "Or what benefit do you see,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:6.2"], "en": "O bird, for yourself and me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:6.3"], "en": "or for our remaining kinsmen?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:6.4"], "en": "When both have reached the end of life,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:7.1", "PA_ja_533:7.2"], "en": "that which has gone into blinding darkness is like the down of a golden peacock feather.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:7.3"], "en": "\"Truly giving up such a life,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:7.4"], "en": "for what purpose would one illuminate it?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:8.1"], "en": "How indeed, O Best of those who fly, [should one do so]?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:8.2"], "en": "You do not perceive the goal within the Dhamma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:8.3"], "en": "yet the Dhamma, when honored,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:8.4"], "en": "reveals the goal to living beings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:9.1"], "en": "Thus, regarding the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:9.2"], "en": "seeing the welfare arising from the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:9.3"], "en": "and beholding my devotion toward you—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:9.4"], "en": "I do not long for life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:10.1"], "en": "Surely this is the law of the virtuous:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:10.2"], "en": "that a friend stands by a friend in times of trouble.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:10.3", "PA_ja_533:10.4"], "en": "One would not abandon even life itself while recollecting the Dhamma as the cause.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:11.1"], "en": "This very Dhamma has been practiced by you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:11.2"], "en": "And my devotion is known to me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:11.3", "PA_ja_533:11.4"], "en": "do as you wish with me, or go, permitted by me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:12.1"], "en": "But even though time has passed in this way,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:12.2"], "en": "that portion [of my wealth] which was entrusted to me by my kinsmen—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:12.3"], "en": "O you who are endowed with wisdom, [restore it to them].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:12.4"], "en": "\"May he be supremely restrained\"—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:13.1", "PA_ja_533:13.2"], "en": "thus did those noble ones of noble conduct deliberate.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:13.3", "PA_ja_533:13.4", "PA_ja_533:14.1"], "en": "The hunter looked back at them like one who brings death to the afflicted; he gazed upon his enemies.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:14.2"], "en": "The twice-born ones were for his long-term welfare;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:14.3", "PA_ja_533:14.4"], "en": "both remained silent and did not stir from their seats.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:15.1", "PA_ja_533:15.2"], "en": "And seeing Dhatarattha rising up from here and there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:15.3"], "en": "advance with speed!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:15.4", "PA_ja_533:16.1"], "en": "The enemy of the twice-born, against the lord of the twice-born; he, having rushed forward with speed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:16.2"], "en": "having assailed the supreme twice-born;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:16.3"], "en": "The hunter turned back, thinking,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:16.4", "PA_ja_533:17.1"], "en": "\"They are caught,\" as he saw one sitting there alone, already bound.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:17.2"], "en": "Furthermore, another who is unbound,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:17.3"], "en": "sitting having assailed one who is bound,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:17.4"], "en": "looking on without seeing any danger.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:18.1"], "en": "Then, still full of doubt,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:18.2", "PA_ja_533:18.3"], "en": "he addressed Paṇḍara as he sat with his body grown large:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:18.4"], "en": "To the Lord of the assembly of the noble ones:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:19.1", "PA_ja_533:19.2"], "en": "“Since he who is bound by a great snare does not look toward the directions;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:19.3", "PA_ja_533:19.4"], "en": "Now, why do you, a strong bird, not fly away while unbound?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:20.1"], "en": "Is this bird indeed yours?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:20.2"], "en": "Being free yourself, you wait upon one who is bound;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:20.3"], "en": "the birds are flying away,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:20.4"], "en": "why are you left behind alone?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:21.1"], "en": "“He is my friend, a brahmin,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:21.2", "PA_ja_533:21.3"], "en": "and a companion as dear to me as life itself; I shall certainly not abandon him.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:21.4"], "en": "“Until the time has come.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:22.1", "PA_ja_533:22.2"], "en": "“But how was it that this bird did not see the snare set?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:22.3"], "en": "For this is the way of the great:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:22.4"], "en": "they are worthy to understand misfortune.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:23.1"], "en": "When ruin occurs—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:23.2"], "en": "When life is at its end,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:23.3", "PA_ja_533:23.4"], "en": "one does not wake up even when encountering a net or a snare.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:24.1"], "en": "Nevertheless, O one of great wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:24.2"], "en": "though snares are spread in many ways,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:24.3"], "en": "they ensnare only those who fall upon what is hidden.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:24.4"], "en": "\"Even so at the end of life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:25.1", "PA_ja_533:25.2"], "en": "\"Is this not a source of happiness for living together with you?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:25.3"], "en": "“Have you granted us permission?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:25.4"], "en": "Have you given us our lives?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:26.1"], "en": "“You are not bound to me at all.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:26.2"], "en": "Nor do I desire your death; by all means,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:26.3", "PA_ja_533:26.4"], "en": "go quickly from here and live long, free from suffering.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:27.1"], "en": "“I do not desire this for him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:27.2"], "en": "other than his life;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:27.3"], "en": "if you are satisfied with just one [of us],”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:27.4"], "en": "Release him, O Mañca, and eat me!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:28.1"], "en": "We two are equal in height and girth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:28.2"], "en": "and we are both the same in age.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:28.3"], "en": "You do not live for the sake of gain;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:28.4", "PA_ja_533:29.1"], "en": "rather, on account of this [teaching], you should indeed look upon it with equanimity.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:29.2"], "en": "Let greed arise for you in your ascetic toil;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:29.3"], "en": "first bind me with the snare,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:29.4"], "en": "O lord of birds, and release me afterwards.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:30.1", "PA_ja_533:30.2"], "en": "At that very moment you gained your wealth through your begging,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:30.3"], "en": "and you have friendship with the Dhataraṭṭhas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:30.4", "PA_ja_533:31.1"], "en": "\"May this last for as long as you live. \"Let the Great Saṅgha see:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:31.2"], "en": "what was released by you has gone from here.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:31.3"], "en": "One's friends, ministers, and servants,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:31.4"], "en": "one's children, wives, and kinsmen—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:32.1"], "en": "such people are not true friends.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:32.2", "PA_ja_533:32.3", "PA_ja_533:32.4"], "en": "Many here possess such [a friend] as you, Dhatarattha’s friend who shares his very life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:33.1"], "en": "Therefore, I release this companion of yours;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:33.2"], "en": "let him be your follower, O King.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:33.3"], "en": "Having gone from here as quickly as you desire, [proceed].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:33.4"], "en": "“Shine forth in the midst of your kinsmen!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:34.1"], "en": "Thus, filled with trepidation,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:34.2"], "en": "he showed reverence for his husband because he had been released by his husband.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:34.3"], "en": "Vakkanga addressed him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:34.4"], "en": "speaking words pleasant to the ear:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:35.1"], "en": "\"Thus, hunter, may you rejoice.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:35.2"], "en": "Together with all my kinsmen,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:35.3", "PA_ja_533:35.4"], "en": "I rejoice today as I behold the Lord of Birds set free.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:36.1", "PA_ja_533:36.2"], "en": "“Come, I shall instruct you so that you too may obtain it;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:36.3"], "en": "this Dhatarattha has brought you this gain.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:36.4"], "en": "He will see nothing evil.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:37.1", "PA_ja_533:37.2"], "en": "Quickly lead us both to the inner palace and show us to the king.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:37.3", "PA_ja_533:37.4", "PA_ja_533:38.1"], "en": "O Great King Dhatarattha, when the axle is unfastened, natural, and situated between both wheels.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:38.2"], "en": "These belong to the Lord of Geese;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:38.3"], "en": "for this king is the lord of geese,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:38.4"], "en": "and he is the supreme commander of the host.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:39.1"], "en": "\"Without doubt, having seen this king of swans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:39.2"], "en": "the lord of men was struck with wonder,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:39.3"], "en": "gladdened, and filled with joy.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:39.4"], "en": "\"He will give you much wealth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:40.1"], "en": "Having heard those words of his,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:40.2"], "en": "he brought it about through his own action.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:40.3"], "en": "Having gone quickly to the inner palace,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:40.4"], "en": "he showed the king the swans;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:40.5"], "en": "they were unbound and in their natural state.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:40.6", "PA_ja_533:41.1", "PA_ja_533:41.2"], "en": "“O Great King, these two are Dhataraṭṭha, the lords of the swans, standing on either side of the king.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:41.3"], "en": "\"For this king is indeed the leader of the swans;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:41.4"], "en": "he is the supreme commander.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:42.1"], "en": "\"But how is it that these birds...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:42.2"], "en": "They have come into your hands;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:42.3", "PA_ja_533:42.4"], "en": "how did the hunter obtain such great and powerful beings here?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:43.1", "PA_ja_533:43.2"], "en": "“These pleasures have been provided for you in these ponds, O lord of men;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:43.3"], "en": "whatever abode you may imagine.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:43.4"], "en": "The trapping of living beings by the twice-born—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:44.1"], "en": "having encountered such a snare,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:44.2"], "en": "the king of swans was caught.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:44.3"], "en": "Seated there, unbound,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:44.4", "PA_ja_533:45.1"], "en": "you addressed me; this is very difficult for those who are ignoble.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:45.2"], "en": "He burns with the highest state;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:45.3"], "en": "striving for the sake of his master,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:45.4"], "en": "he is like a bird bound by its own nature.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:46.1"], "en": "Having sacrificed his own life,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:46.2"], "en": "he who is worthy of life sat there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:46.3"], "en": "uttering no lamentation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:46.4"], "en": "She begged her husband for his life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:47.1"], "en": "Having heard those words of his,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:47.2"], "en": "I attained a state of serene confidence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:47.3", "PA_ja_533:47.4"], "en": "Then I released him from his bonds and permitted him to depart in peace. He,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:48.1"], "en": "being liberated, was filled with joy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:48.2"], "en": "Out of respect for her husband,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:48.3"], "en": "Vakkaṅga addressed her,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:48.4"], "en": "speaking words pleasant to the ear.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:49.1", "PA_ja_533:49.2"], "en": "“Thus, hunter, may you rejoice together with all your kinsmen,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:49.3"], "en": "just as I rejoice today.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:49.4"], "en": "\"Having seen the king of birds who has passed away,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:50.1", "PA_ja_533:50.2"], "en": "come, I shall instruct you so that you too may attain it.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:50.3", "PA_ja_533:50.4"], "en": "\"It is a gain for you that this Dhatarattha sees no evil at all.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:51.1"], "en": "Having quickly led him to the inner palace,\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:51.2"], "en": "\"Show us both to the king—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:51.3", "PA_ja_533:51.4"], "en": "those two yokes standing on either side, unbound and in their natural state.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:52.1"], "en": "“O Great King, these are the Dhataraṭṭhas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:52.2"], "en": "the lords of the swans;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:52.3"], "en": "for this king here is the sovereign of the swans.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:52.4"], "en": "“This is Senāpatītara.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:53.1", "PA_ja_533:53.2"], "en": "Having seen this swan-king, the lord of men will undoubtedly [realize this].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:53.3"], "en": "“Trembling, joyful, and elated,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:53.4"], "en": "he will give you much wealth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:54.1"], "en": "Thus, according to his word,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:54.2"], "en": "Both were brought here by me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:54.3"], "en": "for they were already right here,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:54.4"], "en": "both approved by me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:55.1"], "en": "Thus has this bird gone,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:55.2"], "en": "a twice-born one most righteous in dharma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:55.3"], "en": "for to a hunter such as I, [he is like a son].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:55.4"], "en": "You should produce gentleness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:56.1"], "en": "And as for a gift, O Lord,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:56.2"], "en": "I see none other such as this.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:56.3"], "en": "“In the village of all the fowlers—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:56.4"], "en": "behold him, O lord of men!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:57.1"], "en": "Having seen the king seated there, [he said:]", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:57.2"], "en": "On a beautiful golden seat,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:57.3"], "en": "Vakkaṅga addressed him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:57.4"], "en": "speaking words pleasant to the ear.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:58.1", "PA_ja_533:58.2"], "en": "“Is it well with you, sir? Are you free from illness?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:58.3"], "en": "Is this kingdom prosperous?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:58.4"], "en": "“You instruct me according to the Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:59.1"], "en": "“O swan, it is indeed wholesome for me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:59.2"], "en": "and moreover, O swan, it is free from affliction.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:59.3", "PA_ja_533:59.4"], "en": "\"And thus, governing this prosperous kingdom by means of Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:60.1"], "en": "\"I hope, sire, that among your ministers...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:60.2"], "en": "No fault whatsoever is found;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:60.3", "PA_ja_533:60.4"], "en": "and do they not desire life for the sake of their own welfare?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:61.1", "PA_ja_533:61.2"], "en": "“Furthermore, no fault whatsoever exists among my ministers;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:61.3"], "en": "yet they [act] against my interests.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:61.4"], "en": "They do not long for life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:62.1"], "en": "“Is your wife like you—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:62.2"], "en": "obedient and sweet-spoken?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:62.3"], "en": "“Endowed with sons, beauty, and fame,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:62.4"], "en": "they follow your will and pleasure.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:63.1"], "en": "“Moreover, my wife is my equal;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:63.2"], "en": "Obedient and sweet-spoken,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:63.3"], "en": "endowed with the beauty of a son and great renown,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:63.4"], "en": "she follows my will and authority.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:64.1"], "en": "I hope that you, venerable sir,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:64.2", "PA_ja_533:64.3"], "en": "have not fallen into the hands of a great enemy and encountered vast suffering?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:64.4"], "en": "In that first watch of the night,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:65.1"], "en": "having fallen upon him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:65.2"], "en": "did you crush him with a staff?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:65.3"], "en": "“In this way, for these people,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:65.4"], "en": "there will be safety for as long as that.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:66.1"], "en": "“There was safety, O Great King.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:66.2", "PA_ja_533:66.3"], "en": "Even when such a calamity occurred, he did not do us any harm at all,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:66.4"], "en": "just as an enemy might.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:67.1", "PA_ja_533:67.2"], "en": "The hunter approached him and spoke first; at that time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:67.3"], "en": "he was indeed Sumukha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:67.4"], "en": "The wise one replied.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:68.1"], "en": "Having heard those words,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:68.2"], "en": "he attained a state of serene confidence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:68.3", "PA_ja_533:68.4"], "en": "Then Pāmucī released me from her bonds and permitted me to depart in comfort.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:69.1"], "en": "And this [she did] with a very pleasant countenance.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:69.2"], "en": "This was intended for this purpose:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:69.3", "PA_ja_533:69.4"], "en": "that you, desiring wealth for him, would come into the presence of the Blessed One.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:70.1"], "en": "“Welcome indeed to you, sirs;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:70.2"], "en": "I am delighted by the sight of you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:70.3"], "en": "And this is much wealth, too—”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:70.4"], "en": "“Let him receive as much as he desires.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:71.1", "PA_ja_533:71.2"], "en": "Having satisfied the hunter with wealth, the lord of men—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:71.3"], "en": "He addressed Vakkaṅga,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:71.4"], "en": "speaking words pleasant to the ear:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:72.1"], "en": "\"That Dhamma which is dependent...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:72.2"], "en": "Nothing remains as a burden;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:72.3", "PA_ja_533:72.4"], "en": "you possess sovereignty over all things— rule according to your will.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:73.1"], "en": "Whether for the purpose of enjoying gifts,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:73.2"], "en": "or whatever else is beneficial—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:73.3"], "en": "this wealth I give to you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:73.4"], "en": "“I relinquish my sovereignty to you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:74.1", "PA_ja_533:74.2"], "en": "And so that this wise Sumukha might address me with such words, I grant it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:74.3"], "en": "“Endowed with wisdom regarding sensual pleasures,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:74.4"], "en": "that would be most dear to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:75.1"], "en": "“Indeed, O Great King, I— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:75.2"], "en": "I am like one caught in the midst of enemies,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:75.3", "PA_ja_533:75.4"], "en": "the king of serpents; I am unable to respond, for there can be no such discipline for me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:76.1"], "en": "He is our preeminent lord,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:76.2"], "en": "and you are the supreme being among men,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:76.3"], "en": "the protector of the earth and ruler of humanity.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:76.4"], "en": "Worship is for many reasons.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:77.1", "PA_ja_533:77.2"], "en": "Of those two speaking while the legal decision is being carried out:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:77.3", "PA_ja_533:77.4"], "en": "\"O lord of men, the hunter must subsequently be dealt with according to the law.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:78.1"], "en": "\"Indeed, by the law,\" [said the king]. \"The hunter—\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:78.2"], "en": "\"The wise one is egg-born\"—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:78.3", "PA_ja_533:78.4"], "en": "such a principle cannot apply to one who has not yet acted.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:79.1"], "en": "Thus of the highest nature,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:79.2"], "en": "thus the most excellent beings—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:79.3"], "en": "however many have been seen by me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:79.4"], "en": "I see nothing else like this:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:80.1", "PA_ja_533:80.2"], "en": "I am pleased with you by nature and by your sweet speech.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:80.3", "PA_ja_533:80.4"], "en": "\"And this desire of mine is that you both might see [him] for a long time.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:81.1"], "en": "Whatever must be done for a supreme friend...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:81.2"], "en": "Among which of us was it given by you?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:81.3"], "en": "We have undoubtedly received it from you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:81.4"], "en": "for whatever devotion you have toward us.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:82.1", "PA_ja_533:82.2"], "en": "Surely this must be a great secret of the circle of kinsmen,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:82.3"], "en": "kept from our sight.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:82.4", "PA_ja_533:83.1"], "en": "Suffering among many birds. To dispel their sorrow,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:83.2"], "en": "we were authorized by you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:83.3"], "en": "Having circumambulated him to the right,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:83.4"], "en": "O subduer of Māra, they would see their kinsman;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:84.1"], "en": "indeed, I would experience vast joy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:84.2"], "en": "I find delight in seeing you;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:84.3"], "en": "this too shall be a great benefit:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:84.4"], "en": "the reassurance of my kinsmen.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:85.1"], "en": "Having said this to the lord of men,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:85.2"], "en": "Dhatarattha, the king of swans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:85.3"], "en": "exerting his supreme speed, departed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:85.4"], "en": "They approached the assembly of kinsmen.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:86.1", "PA_ja_533:86.2"], "en": "Seeing those two supreme brahmins arrived in good health, they [welcomed them].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:86.3", "PA_ja_533:86.4"], "en": "The cries of \"Keka! from the crocodiles and the calls of the swans produced a great clamor;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:87.1"], "en": "they were overcome by the one who had been liberated.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:87.2"], "en": "Out of respect for their husband,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:87.3", "PA_ja_533:87.4"], "en": "the egg-born creatures, having received their opportunity, flocked around him from all sides.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:88.1"], "en": "Thus, for those who possess friends,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:88.2"], "en": "all matters turn out favorably,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:88.3"], "en": "just as with the swans of Dhatarattha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:88.4"], "en": "\"They approached the circle of kinsmen.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_533:89.1"], "en": "Thus ends the first Jātaka, the Cūḷahaṁsa-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
